\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2.2}{\ignorespaces Stakeholder perspectives and fairness lenses in recommender systems. Provider-side fairness is also called producer-side or item-side equity in the literature; platform-level fairness captures aggregate ecosystem outcomes that may look acceptable in a single snapshot but deteriorate under feedback.}}{34}{table.caption.28}%
