\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Summary statistics for all five datasets after $k$-core filtering (thresholds $k_U = k_I = 10$). Density is computed as $|\mathcal {D}| / (|\mathcal {U}| \times |\mathcal {I}|)$.}}{58}{table.caption.50}%
