\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces Comparison of SVD and TF-IDF feedback trajectories at round zero (baseline) and round five (final). ARP is the average recommendation popularity. ``Agg. diversity'' is the count of distinct items recommended across all test users. $\Delta $NDCG is the NDCG@10 gap between mainstream and niche user cohorts (positive = mainstream advantaged). All values are rounded to the nearest integer for ARP and diversity counts.}}{86}{table.caption.80}%
